{title: Resurrecting}
{artist: Elevation Worship}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
The head that [G]once was [Bm]crowned with [A]thorns
Is crowned with [G]glory [D]now
The Savior [G]knelt to [Bm]wash our [A]feet
Now at his [G]feet we [D]bow

{comment: Verse 2}
The one who [G]wore our [Bm]sin and [A]shame
Now robed in [G]majes[D]ty
The [G]radiance of [Bm]perfect [A]love
Now shines for [G]all to [D]see

{comment: Chorus}
Your [G]name, Your [D]name is [A]victory
All [G]praise, Will [D]rise to [A]Christ our king

{comment: Verse 3}
The fear that [G]held us [Bm]now gives [A]way
To him who [G]is our [D]peace
His final [G]breath [Bm]upon the [A]cross
Is now [G]alive in [D]me

{comment: Bridge}
[G]   By your [D]spirit I will [A]rise
From the [D/F#]ashes of [G]defeat
The [D]resurrected [A]king, Is resurrecting [G]me
In your [D]name I come [A]alive
To [D/F#]declare your [G]victory
