{comment: Verse 4}
The tomb where [G]soldiers [Bm]watched in [A]vain
Was borrowed [G]for three [D]days
His body [G]there would [Bm]not [A]remain
Our God has [G]robbed the [D]grave
Our God has [G]robbed the [D]grave
